{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN", "offset": 293, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f154f276f0af8143f0b3f0b4f7d1", "baseline_text": "있잖아，홍란…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ねえ、紅蘭……", "pointer_offset": 248, "unit": "dialogue:5c8d42e678180d07", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN", "offset": 308, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "fb89f0d8f1438143f0aff0b2f0aef0aa81442f2ff1f7fad6f140f8b9f560f1ccf0b2f1488148", "baseline_text": "왜 그래，아이리스．//전투 중에 웬일이야？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "どうしたんや、アイリス。//戦闘中に、めずらしいな？", "pointer_offset": 252, "unit": "dialogue:b0b68b0e7bddefb9", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN", "offset": 359, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f15a8143f0b9f7d12f2ff0b2f248f0b98143f177f16bf8b9f0e2f14bf1472f2ff144f272fb4df3ebf0a2f9c7f14bf1478144", "baseline_text": "어，에…//이번에，광무에 대해서//가르쳐 줬으면 해서．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "え、えーと……//こんど、こうぶについて//おしえてもらいたいなーって。", "pointer_offset": 256, "unit": "dialogue:68ae09f588241492", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN", "offset": 428, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f25c8143f273f274f941f1a9f18df7d12f2ff1def0faf94ffb89f0d8f1438148", "baseline_text": "뭐，괜찮긴 한데…//갑자기 왜 그래？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "まぁ、ええけど……//急にどうしたん？", "pointer_offset": 260, "unit": "dialogue:1e098c03c643610c", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN", "offset": 465, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f15a8143f0b9f372f372f7d12f2ff25c8143f273f274f276f0af81442f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aaf8e1f293f35cf0b2f14881b8", "baseline_text": "어，에헤헤…//뭐，괜찮잖아．//아이리스의 부탁이야∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "え、えへへ……//まぁ、いいでしょ。//アイリスのおねがい！", "pointer_offset": 264, "unit": "dialogue:6354db08b9071972", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN", "offset": 522, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef0f0f7d1f0d8f2ca81432f2ff8b2f1f7f2d6f944f3a1f0b1f1c781432f2ff0aff9e2f0faf1d5f8b6f144f272fb4df285f0f18144", "baseline_text": "그렇네…그럼，//이 전투가 끝나면，//아주 자세히 가르쳐 줄게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "せやな……ほな、//この戦闘がおわったら、//とっくりと教えたるわ。", "pointer_offset": 268, "unit": "dialogue:6167c7db86b6533e", "prior_review": "이슈 #7: 홍란 경상도 사투리"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN", "offset": 587, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d48143f0a5f58ef451f8f3f565f5dc2f2ff2e1fa7cfa99f16ff0f3f18df7d12f2ff0f7f0b5f957f25df29ef0a48148", "baseline_text": "하지만，하룻밤은 꼬박//걸릴 것 같은데…//각오는 됐겠지？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも、たっぷり一晩は//かかると思うで……//覚悟はええな？", "pointer_offset": 272, "unit": "dialogue:b7bcaf47ce55d7a7", "prior_review": "재검수2"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN", "offset": 644, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0aff0a5f3a481b82f2ff2c9f2e9f15a8143f0b3f0b481b82f2ff0d8f2ca8143f0b1f140f8b9f34981b8", "baseline_text": "아하핫∈//알았어，홍란∈//그럼，나중에 봐∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "アハッ！//わかったよ、紅蘭！//じゃ、あとでね∈", "pointer_offset": 276, "unit": "dialogue:1f156276f1effcdc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN", "offset": 691, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "8169f0b3f0b4f7d12f2ff177f96bf0b2f148f14ff8e7f94bfa85f16e81432f2ff1c3f1c8f9c9f1acf0b2f184f7d1816a", "baseline_text": "（홍란…//광무 이야기를 해 줄 때，//즐거워 보이고…）", "kind": "ascr", "source": "（紅蘭……//　こうぶのお話をしてくれる時、//　楽しそうだし……）", "pointer_offset": 280, "unit": "dialogue:9ffea6ad96b869ae", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN", "offset": 756, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "8169f0d8f143f1478143f14ff18cf0c82f2ff2bdf0aef9c7f1cff29ef0f0816a", "baseline_text": "（그래서，기운을//차리면 좋겠네）", "kind": "ascr", "source": "（それで、元気に//　なってくれるといいな）", "pointer_offset": 284, "unit": "dialogue:74e77ace5d7deb5d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02022.SBN", "offset": 799, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 288, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
